*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0029
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-01-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 414
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0029.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FEE0029C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 OVERLIMIT-FEE      PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 3000-COUNT-FEE
    PERFORM BUSINESS-SURCHARGE
    DISPLAY "OVERLIMIT-FEE=" OVERLIMIT-FEE
    STOP RUN.
3000-COUNT-FEE.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    IF MONTHLY-TXNS > 15
        COMPUTE OVERLIMIT-FEE = (MONTHLY-TXNS - 15) * 0.50
    END-IF.
BUSINESS-SURCHARGE.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'B' AND MONTHLY-TXNS > 45
        ADD 25 TO OVERLIMIT-FEE
    END-IF.
